      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2679514037,
          "type": null,
          "body": "`qt/wireless_frame.cpp` already includes `wsutil/802_11-utils.h`. It makes sense to put a utility function like this in libwsutil/802_11-utils.[ch] It's even possible that there's *already* a utility function that does this in that file and header, though I haven't looked.",
