      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2679514468,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "A nice thing about putting this in `wsutil/802_11-utils.c` is that file already includes `wsutil/array.h`, which defines the same macro:\n\n```\n/** Useful when you have an array whose size is known at compile-time. */\n#define array_length(x) (sizeof (x) / sizeof (x)[0])\n```",
